1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:05,720
Read the lesson together with teacher.

2
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:10,570
The Lion and the Mouse

3
00:00:10,570 --> 00:00:16,250
One day, the mouse is caught by the lion.

4
00:00:16,250 --> 00:00:22,320
The mouse says: - Please spare me, sir.

5
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:29,420
The lion pities the small mouse, lets the mouse go.

6
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:33,450
The mouse says:

7
00:00:33,450 --> 00:00:40,400
- Thank you sir. One day I will help you again.

8
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:47,570
After a while, the lion is caught in a net.

9
00:00:47,570 --> 00:00:57,550
The mouse sees that, tries hard to chew through the net, saves the lion.

10
00:00:57,550 --> 00:01:04,750
From then on, the lion and the mouse are best friends.

